    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are not the first. You will not be the last.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/085800040dade876acb15a1034784c3d.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/085800040dade876acb15a1034784c3d.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/085800040dade876acb15a1034784c3d.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the derelict carcass of a terraforming dream gone wrong, you awaken as <strong>Alexandro</strong>\u2014a clone soldier with a fractured mind and a weapon fused to your arm. The <strong>D.R.I.L.L.</strong> hums with unstable energy, its cores crackling with the power to shock, push, or freeze\u2026 but every shot drains your suit\u2019s fading pulse. Memories glitch. Voices lie. And the hive <i>hungers</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/980d1ec0b27b135b6e23f3ea9af4af1a.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/980d1ec0b27b135b6e23f3ea9af4af1a.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/980d1ec0b27b135b6e23f3ea9af4af1a.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Descent Into Adaptive Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>The Clone Awakening Facility</strong><br><i>&quot;Welcome to your first death, A-65177.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/dc1e116628221889cd686eed65e44c85.avif?t=1744739610\" data-has-big width=800 height=1035 /></span><br>Escape laboratories where glass vats birth nightmares. Parasites skitter in the shadows, lured by the scent of fresh code in your veins. Solve your own corpse\u2019s puzzles. Trust Roxana\u2019s holographic whispers\u2014or let Filipo\u2019s static-choked screams guide you. But hurry: the lights are failing, and <i>something</i> is peeling through the ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/75523c049ed19ae95655174ed4a6ff28.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/75523c049ed19ae95655174ed4a6ff28.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/75523c049ed19ae95655174ed4a6ff28.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>The Magnetic Abyss</strong><br><i>Gravity here is a liar.</i><br>Navigate caves where floating ore crushes the unwary. Redirect tractor beams to carve paths through the dark, but tread lightly\u2014the walls breathe. Swarms detach like living rot, exploding in bioluminescent fury. Your D.R.I.L.L.\u2019s Push Core might save you\u2026 or hurl you into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/f8b47cf8737581b190fe88d34ad1d467.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/f8b47cf8737581b190fe88d34ad1d467.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/f8b47cf8737581b190fe88d34ad1d467.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Lighthouse of Annihilation</strong><br><i>The light that cleanses. The light that consumes.</i><br>Climb the skeletal spire where humanity\u2019s last hope became a meat grinder. Machinery clogs with pulsating biomass. Filipo awaits, half-man, half-hive, his bones snapping into new horrors as you fight. Survive the beacon\u2019s final truth: you are a cog in a cycle older than your stolen memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/42f2a7f7c9a74e18ac53dcd04c7f80f6.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/42f2a7f7c9a74e18ac53dcd04c7f80f6.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/42f2a7f7c9a74e18ac53dcd04c7f80f6.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Repeat.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve or Die</strong>: Enemies learn. Sentry Drones stalk via light, Grunt Berserkers feign death to ambush, and the Nematophora King <i>reshapes itself</i> mid-battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/a11711b5b546b07b88e33a87bf029de2.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/a11711b5b546b07b88e33a87bf029de2.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/a11711b5b546b07b88e33a87bf029de2.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left-Arm Lies</strong>: Your holographic UI flickers with inventory and cryptic warnings. Is Roxana guiding you\u2026 or editing your reality?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/e78e78e73e7cb747c62c1bd919583543.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/e78e78e73e7cb747c62c1bd919583543.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/e78e78e73e7cb747c62c1bd919583543.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battery-Powered Desperation</strong>: Every beam fired, every adrenaline shot taken, risks your suit\u2019s stability. Will you burn bright or ration survival?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/220340b10cc43a4521dfac43df9ace83.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/220340b10cc43a4521dfac43df9ace83.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/220340b10cc43a4521dfac43df9ace83.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Pilot</strong> is a haunting dance of body horror and tactical decay. Forge alliances with ghosts, outsmart a hive that remembers your every death, and ask yourself: <i>Is breaking the cycle worth becoming the monster?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/3babe95e4607a9252c3caa7cefe7dceb.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/3babe95e4607a9252c3caa7cefe7dceb.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/3babe95e4607a9252c3caa7cefe7dceb.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A claustrophobic nightmare where every choice bleeds consequence. For fans who crave the tension of Alien: Isolation and the existential dread of Hellblade.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/c1769539a54706f022e4ace8f96fef7e.poster.avif?t=1744739610\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/c1769539a54706f022e4ace8f96fef7e.webm?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885710/extras/c1769539a54706f022e4ace8f96fef7e.mp4?t=1744739610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
